      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE DEPUTY (1) resumes here but the form he showed when last in work was good enough for a race of this calibre. Has remarkably only missed a drum once in 14 attempts over this course and distance and gets some weight relief with the 2kg claim. Rates the testing material. The well-related IRAMA (5) (half to G2 winner Serasana) loves this distance range with a win and three seconds from five starts and will be ready to peak now third run back from the break. Expect a bold showing. DON PEDRO (2) has placed over this track and trip and maps ideally for this from gate three. Don't dismiss lightly. ROTHGO (8) got the job done at Warwick last time out and will have taken some confidence from that victory. Can go back-to-back. MISS DE MEDICI (9) next best with the light weight.",
